<section id="section-one">
<h2>Section One</h2>
<p>Paragraph with <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <span class="docutils literal">literal</span>, <cite>interpreted</cite>,
<sub>sub</sub> and <sup>sup</sup> text, a <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/">reference</a> <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-4" id="footnote-reference-6" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>4<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>, an <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/anon">anonymous one</a> <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-5" id="footnote-reference-7" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>5<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>, a
footnote <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-1" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>1<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>, an auto footnote <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-2" id="footnote-reference-2" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>2<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>, labeled <a class="brackets" href="#lbl" id="footnote-reference-3" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>3<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a>, symbol <a class="brackets" href="#footnote-3" id="footnote-reference-4" role="doc-noteref"><span class="fn-bracket">[</span>*<span class="fn-bracket">]</span></a> and a
citation <a class="citation-reference" href="#cit2002" id="citation-reference-1" role="doc-biblioref">[CIT2002]</a>.  Inline <span class="target" id="target">target</span> here; replaced <em>text</em> too.  Standalone
<a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/x?y=1#z">https://example.org/x?y=1#z</a> and <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#64;example.org">mailto:me&#64;example.org</a>, <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#64;example.org">me&#64;example.org</a>.</p>
